{"id":"419849","name":"猪肝花菜羹","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/419849/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花菜","amount":"180克"},{"name":"猪肝","amount":"85克"}],"sub":[{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：花菜（已清洗）、猪肝（已切片浸泡在清水中）。","img":"images/419849/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水淀粉。","img":"images/419849/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将浸泡好的猪肝尽量去掉血水，捞出控干一些水分，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/419849/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量的淀粉。","img":"images/419849/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/419849/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将拌好的猪肝下入沸水中焯一下，捞出待用。","img":"images/419849/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入已清洗好的花菜翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/419849/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"随后，加适量的清水煮开，煮至花菜熟软。","img":"images/419849/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着，合入焯好的猪肝翻动一下。","img":"images/419849/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/419849/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/419849/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入水淀粉。","img":"images/419849/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"勾芡翻匀，即成。","img":"images/419849/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}